# Local build artifacts are not part of the upstream sources and must not
# be represented in the auto-generated quilt diff. The regex is matched
# against pathnames relative to the source root (see dpkg-source(1)).
#
# `vendor` is intentionally NOT listed here: it is part of the upstream
# source (shipped in the .orig.tar.*), so it is not a local change.
extend-diff-ignore = (^|/)(\.flatpak-builder|\.flatpak-build|build-dir|node_modules|target|\.cargo)(/|$)|^tauri/(dist|src-tauri/gen)(/|$)|\.snap$
